        "rotation": 0,
        "text": "OFFICE OF THE ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER OF STATE TAX\nCommercial Taxes Department · Northline Division\nReference No: ZD2910260012345 Date: 20 October 2026\nSubject: Notice under Section 61 for intimating discrepancies in the return (Form GST ASMT-10)\nTo: Harbour Valley Components Pvt Ltd, GSTIN 29AAACH0000A1Z5, Tax period April 2025 to\nMarch 2026.\nOn scrutiny of the returns filed for the above period, discrepancies were noticed in the input tax\ncredit claimed against the supplier statements.\nYou are hereby directed to explain the discrepancies and pay the tax of Rs. 4,52,300 with\ninterest within 30 days of receipt of this notice.\nA personal hearing is fixed on 18 November 2026 at 11:00 AM before the undersigned at the\nDivision office.\nFailure to reply will attract proceedings under Section 73(1) of the Act, including a penalty of Rs.\n2.5 lakh, without further notice.\nSd/- Assistant Commissioner of State Tax",
